	(text_box "ESP32C5 SETUP NOTES:\n1. Set GPIO0 through GPIO MATRIX to GPIO (From 32K XTAL)\n2. Set GPIO1 through GPIO MATRIX to GPI1 (From 32K XTAL)\n3. To enable programming through the JTAG pins eFuse 2: EFUSE_DIS_USB_JTAG has to be set to 1 (default 0)\n   - Set BOOT pins to Joint Download Boot 1 mode (to download through JTAG pins)\n   - In Joint Download Boot 1 mode, the USB Serial/JTAG controller is forcibly disabled, and the JTAG signal only comes from JTAG pins."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 194.564 29.21 0)
